  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Support to the Acholi Religious Leaders Peace Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To create a conducive environment for sustainable peace and development in Northern Uganda&#x2019;
Output 1. ARLPI has contributed to solving conflicts in a non-violent way 
Outout 2. Community members (women and men) and peace committees have been assisted to mitigate conflict situations in a non-violence and promote reconciliation.</narrative>
  </description>
